WEBVTT

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:05.740
Transfers between accounts

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:10.074
Open Finance, then Accounts, and go to the Transfers tab.

00:00:15.264 --> 00:00:17.413
Press Record Transfer.

00:00:18.992 --> 00:00:23.391
Choose the account the money leaves, and the account that receives it.

00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:28.923
Enter the amount and a short description.

00:00:35.258 --> 00:00:39.791
Press Review Transfer to check the details before anything is saved.

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:48.726
Press Confirm Transfer. Both account balances update, and the transfer is listed.

00:00:52.249 --> 00:00:56.920
Transfer recorded
